    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Unity Field.</strong> Your conviction radiates outward like a stabilizing field.</p><ul><li>While you are conscious, you emit a 2 squares aura. Allies in the aura (including you) reroll the lowest die on defense checks against being <strong>charmed</strong> or <strong>Shaken</strong>.</li><li>Once per turn when a creature starts its turn in your aura, you can grant it temporary Integrity equal to your Presence modifier (no action required).</li></ul><p>(The Active Effect marks you as projecting the Unity Field aura; GMs and scripts can key off this flag.)</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
